ts.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-737f2c2a4fe04e98END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1281b353626d3857END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_CRE_RecordOfComplaints</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CRE_RecordOfComplaints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CRE_RecordOfComplaints\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6403e765-b660-4f80-a6cb-bc038179001c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6403e765-b660-4f80-a6cb-bc038179001c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6403e765-b660-4f80-a6cb-bc038179001c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf near the Gremishka Nest on the upper floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;46&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;39</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A dust-covered tome of complaints to the Dawnmaster.]\n</p><p><br>\nWho allowed a pilgrim to <a href=\"/wiki/Winery_Records\" title=\"Winery Records\">pay for wine with a cat</a>? And what sort of cat even is it?! One of my novices told me they saw it grow to the size of a humongous hound. That was moments before it attacked. The poor novice didn't stop trembling for a tenday. Please, I beg of you, can we just accept gold for goods like ordinary folk? And for gods' sakes, call on someone to get rid of that nasty animal!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200708\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1864/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32844/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9294/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935114/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.596      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.596      1 -total\n 66.65%   31.724      8 Template:Icon_text\n 59.47%   28.305     19 Template:Trim\n 34.13%   16.246      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.02%   16.191      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.51%   13.568      2 Template:CharLink\n 28.47%   13.549      3 Template:Icon_link\n 20.58%    9.793      8 Template:Ifempty\n 19.69%    9.373      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12580-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200708 and revision id 330484. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}